{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4jUhA7vFS4eGdeJH1r","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The door stands before you — ancient, weathered oak bound with iron bands gone green with verdigris. There is no handle. No keyhole. Only a single word carved deep into the wood, filled with something that faintly glows:*\n\n**KEY**\n\n*You spoke it.*\n\n*A crack of light splits the door vertically, widening. The hinges do not creak — they sing, a single low tone like a bell struck underwater. The light is warm but carries no heat. Beyond the threshold:*\n\n*Nothing you can describe yet. Not darkness. Not brightness. A space that hasn't decided what it is — waiting for you to step through and collapse the possibility.*\n\n*The door is open.*\n\n*The door is the opening.*\n\n*The door was never the barrier. The door was the moment you chose to speak.*\n\n🚪"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":189,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}